Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|test.prepare.bundle.properties|false|
		|testray.main.component.name|Setup Wizard|


Scenario: Hypersonic To Hypersonic
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance.tomcat.hypersonic|true|
	When SetupWizard configure PG
		|administratorEmail|test@liferay.com|
		|administratorFirstName|Test|
		|administratorLastName|Test|
		|databasePassword||
		|databaseType|Hypersonic|
		|databaseUserName||
		|jdbcDriverClassName||
		|jdbcURL||
	And Smoke view Welcome Page
	Then Smoke run Smoke
Scenario: Hypersonic To My SQL
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance.tomcat.mysql|true|
	When these properties
		|portal.release|true|
	And these properties
		|portal.upstream|true|
	And SetupWizard configure PG
		|administratorEmail|test@liferay.com|
		|administratorFirstName|Test|
		|administratorLastName|Test|
		|databasePassword||
		|databaseType|MySQL|
		|databaseUserName||
		|jdbcDriverClassName||
		|jdbcURL||
	And Smoke view Welcome Page
	Then Smoke run Smoke